---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Books as Investment" active="investment">
  <section class="page-banner">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Rare books as an asset</p>
      <h1>Books as Investment</h1>
      <p>A well-chosen first edition is a tangible, finite asset — one you can also read. Rare books have historically held their value through economic cycles, with the finest copies appreciating steadily as condition, provenance and demand narrow supply.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <strong>4.6%</strong>
          <span>Average annual appreciation across the collection</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <strong>15%</strong>
          <span>Peak single-year gain on selected rare first editions</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <strong>£300</strong>
          <span>Half-day rate for a formal written valuation</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background:var(--parchment-deep); padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head left">
        <p class="eyebrow">What drives value</p>
        <h2>What makes a book a good investment</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="process">
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="num">Edition</span>
          <h3>First editions &amp; printings</h3>
          <p>True first editions, especially first printings in the original binding or jacket, carry the strongest long-term demand.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="num">Condition</span>
          <h3>Condition &amp; restoration</h3>
          <p>Professional restoration can meaningfully lift value — every book we sell is assessed and repaired by expert craftsmen first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="num">Provenance</span>
          <h3>History &amp; signatures</h3>
          <p>Author signatures, inscriptions, and a documented ownership history add a premium collectors are willing to pay for.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center; max-width:640px;">
      <h2>Thinking about buying, selling, or having a collection valued?</h2>
      <p>Our team can provide an initial verbal assessment free of charge, followed by a cost estimate before any formal valuation work begins.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Request a valuation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
